Z||000005||1FST2M6||10-24-2000||04:22 PM||||you can run a 40hp shot thats 130lbft ALL DAY!!! it's front tire lifting O  M   G  THIS CAR IS STOOOPID fast acceleration.. i did... my best hp numbers were 164hp and 310lbft at the wheels... the normal driving i had 164hp and 247lbft at the wheels! i can' post dyno results if ya like. <A HREF="http://www.nosnitrous.com" TARGET=_blank>www.nosnitrous.com</A>  part # 05120, or #13093 from <A HREF="http://www.nitrousworks.com" TARGET=_blank>www.nitrousworks.com</A>  ENJOY!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <P>oh your' pistons will melt faster then you can let off the button, your head bolts will break and all the attached parts WILL pierce the frame and fire wall.  if you had a 150 single stage kit..  on a PROPERLY installed single stage kit your car CANNOT trip the nitrous solenoid at idle.. the fuel pressure isn't high enough and the WOT switch can't be triped at part or no throttle. I did however STAND on the bottle at 1400rpm at lights EVERY time i was provoked by a gimpy mustang, camaro etc.. you'll be surprised... and so will the other driver!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <P>------------------<BR>Shhh.. Top Secret! <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/1fstcheeto_2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
